19 20.8625 19 21.635C19 32.465 26.535 40 37.365 40C38.1375 40 38.4 39.3325 38.4 38.765V35.9875C38.4 35.42 37.9325 34.9525 37.365 34.9525H36.365V33.9525Z" fill="#003366"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></nav><main><div class="d-none"><h1>Puravankara – Innovating Real Estate with Sustainability &amp; Technology</h1></div><div class="d-none"><h2>What Sets Us Apart, OUR JOURNEY, About Founder, Group of companies</h2></div><div class="d-none"><h3>Sustainable Luxury, Built for the Future</h3></div><div class="banner_homebanner__dx8pI"><div class="sliderItem innerpagebanner position-relative overlaynone"><img alt="Top Builders and Developers in Bangalore" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="d-none d-md-block img-fluid w-100" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-01.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-01.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-01.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/><img alt="/uploads/50_Years_web_page-01.webp" width="500" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="d-block d-md-none img-fluid w-100" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-03_1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-03_1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_web_page-03_1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/><div class="captionbox position-absolute left-0 w-100"><div class="container"></div></div></div></div><div class="d-lg-flex breadcrumb pt-3 pt-lg-4 bg-gray fw-600 align-items-center fs-12 fw-400 px-lg-5 px-md-3 px-2 text-white"><p class="brd-crum-bb"><a href="/" class="text-b px-0 sec_subtitle text-capitalize fw-100">Home</a></p></div><section class="sec-padd position-relative overflow-hidden"><div class="container"><div class="g-4 align-items-center row"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="imgwrap mt-4 mt-md-0 position-relative highprior" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px)"><div class="sustainimg"><img alt="project image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="img-fluid position-relative object-fit-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Foverview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="head_wrap"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title  " data-splitting="">What Sets Us Apart</h3></div></div><div class="contentwrap"><p style="margin-left:0cm;">Founded in 1975, Puravankara Limited is one of India’s most admired and trusted developers among the&nbsp;top real estate companies in India. The Company has its headquarters in Bengaluru.</p><p style="margin-left:0cm;">For five decades, the brand has been built on an unwavering commitment towards customer delight, responsibility, and trust.&nbsp; Every Puravankara home reflects our respect for one of life’s most important investments. By placing customers at the centre of every decision we take, we continue to create enduring spaces that combine quality, reliability, and lasting value.</p><p style="margin-left:0cm;">Puravankara has launched three prominent brands. Puravankara itself is recognized for its luxurious, state-of-the-art projects that incorporate innovative technology to redefine future homes. Provident Housing Ltd., a wholly owned subsidiary launched in 2008, addresses the needs of mid-income homeowners. Additionally, Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) provide technology-enabled construction solutions.</p><p style="margin-left:0cm;">The Puravankara brand also has a strong presence in commercial office spaces.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="rotatebox bottomright mt-5" style="transform:scale(1.5)"></div><div class="rotatebox topleft mt-5"></div></section><div class="d-md-block d-none"><section id="our-mission"><div class="container"><div class="overflow-hidden position-relative d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height:50vh"><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 position-absolute h-100  w-50 start-0 "><div class="our-mission-img h-100"><img loading="lazy" width="603" height="473" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 h-100 img-fluid" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 position-absolute w-50  end-0 h-100 "><div class="our-mission-content"><h5>Our Vision</h5><p>To create a sustainable world for people to live their dreams.</p></div></div><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 position-absolute h-100  w-50 start-0 "><div class="our-mission-content"><h5>&quot;The You&quot; Philosophy</h5><p>At Puravankara, all our endeavours revolve around just one entity - our customers. Their need, dreams and aspirations are pivotal to our decisions. We call this &quot;The you philosophy&quot;.</p></div></div><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 position-absolute w-50  end-0 h-100 "><div class="our-mission-img h-100"><img loading="lazy" width="603" height="473" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 h-100  img-fluid" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="d-md-none d-block"><section class="sec-padd h-100 pt-0" id="our-mission"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 col-md-6"><div class="our-mission-img"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 img-fluid" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fmission_7dd61b7161.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 col-md-6"><div class="our-mission-content"><h5>Our Vision</h5><p>To create a sustainable world for people to live their dreams.</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 mt-4 col-md-6"><div class="our-mission-img"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 img-fluid" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimage_16_a22620a905.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-md-0 px-md-0 col-md-6"><div class="our-mission-content"><h5>&quot;The You&quot; Philosophy</h5><p>At Puravankara, all our endeavours revolve around just one entity - our customers. Their need, dreams and aspirations are pivotal to our decisions. We call this &quot;The you philosophy&quot;.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="rotatebox bottomleft  mt-5"></div></section></div><section id="quality-policy" class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 sec-padd position-relative"><div class="container"><h3 class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 section-title  animtitle text-center">Our Quality Policy</h3><div class="g-4 row"><div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12"><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-card position-relative overflow-hidden rounded shadow-sm"><img alt="Quality Management System" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimg_1_a942151cc4.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimg_1_a942151cc4.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fimg_1_a942151cc4.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-title-default position-absolute start-0 bottom-0 w-100 p-2 text-center text-white"><h5 class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1">Quality Management System</h5></div><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-overlay position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center text-center p-3"><p class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-text mt-2"><p>Quality Management System’ is a repository of processes and systems, which deﬁne all activities at Puravankara. The QMS ensures delivery of a quality product at optimum cost and minimum impact to the environment and society at large. QMS training is mandatory for all employees. Puravankara’s QMS conforms to the ISO 9001 standard.</p></p><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 mt-3"></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12"><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-card position-relative overflow-hidden rounded shadow-sm"><img alt="Project Management" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_6fab44c9a5.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_6fab44c9a5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_6fab44c9a5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-title-default position-absolute start-0 bottom-0 w-100 p-2 text-center text-white"><h5 class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1">Project Management</h5></div><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-overlay position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center text-center p-3"><p class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-text mt-2"><p>Project Management is a monthly review of ongoing projects where PICs present progress reports aligned with international best practices, covering progress, cost, inventory, and risks. Senior management participation enables quick issue resolution and faster execution. Projects are rated on progress, schedule, cost, quality, safety, and housekeeping, with monthly commendations for outstanding projects and quarterly awards for best-in-class performance.</p></p><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 mt-3"></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12"><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-card position-relative overflow-hidden rounded shadow-sm"><img alt="Environment, Health And Safety (EHS) Policy" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_1483b430a7.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_1483b430a7.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_1483b430a7.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-title-default position-absolute start-0 bottom-0 w-100 p-2 text-center text-white"><h5 class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1">Environment, Health And Safety (EHS) Policy</h5></div><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 quality-overlay position-absolute top-0 start-0 w-100 h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center text-center p-3"><p class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 overlay-text mt-2"><p>We stand fully committed to Environment, Health and Safety (EHS). We set our EHS objectives and programmes and take frequent and necessary actions to achieve continue improvement and desired outcomes.</p></p><div class="jsx-fa0650cd1eff70b1 mt-3"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec-pad pt-5 overflow-hidden amenitiessec "><div class="w-100"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="head_wrap text-center"><h3 class="section-title mb-0 text-white">OUR JOURNEY</h3></div></div></div><div class="pt-0 pb-4 py-md-4"><div class="swiper legacy_slider pb-5"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F1_7ef21c19cd.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F1_7ef21c19cd.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F1_7ef21c19cd.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">1975</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Year of establishment</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_2de66a94bb.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_2de66a94bb.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F2_2de66a94bb.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">1986</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Incorporated as Puravankara projects Ltd</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_88edfcfaf8.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_88edfcfaf8.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F3_88edfcfaf8.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">1989</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara establishes presence in Dubai 
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F4_d90cd98fc2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F4_d90cd98fc2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F4_d90cd98fc2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">1997</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara unveils India&#x27;s first-ever large-scale themed development
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F5_7b5910d7c0.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F5_7b5910d7c0.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F5_7b5910d7c0.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">1998</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Mr. Ravi Puravankara appointed President of Fédération Internationale des Administrateurs de Bien-Conselis Immobiliers (FIABCI) India 
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F6_44c5ec7546.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F6_44c5ec7546.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F6_44c5ec7546.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2001</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) is conceptualised 
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F7_71214fd8e1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F7_71214fd8e1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F7_71214fd8e1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2005</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">We proudly became one of the first real estate developers in India to attract foreign direct investment and secure FDI. We formed a landmark joint venture with Keppel Investments Mauritius Limited a subsidiary of Singapore-based Keppel Land to establish Keppel Puravankara Development Pvt Ltd.</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F8_a741e256a5.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F8_a741e256a5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F8_a741e256a5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2006</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara establishes office in Colombo, Sri Lanka
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fm3_85ca3354b6.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fm3_85ca3354b6.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2Fm3_85ca3354b6.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2007</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara is listed on Bombay Stock Exchange and National Stock Exchange
</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175104_134_584c1af46f.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175104_134_584c1af46f.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175104_134_584c1af46f.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2007</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Purva Streaks, in-house home interior brand of Puravankara Limited, is conceptualised</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F10_1ac2bfad7d.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F10_1ac2bfad7d.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F10_1ac2bfad7d.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2008</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">We launched Provident Housing Limited, a wholly owned subsidiary of Puravankara, to meet the aspirations of mid-income housing segment in India.</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F11_2a6c330666.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F11_2a6c330666.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F11_2a6c330666.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2009</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited set up as a 100% subsidiary to enhance competitiveness through backward integration in construction</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F13_6de6b8c053.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F13_6de6b8c053.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F13_6de6b8c053.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2012</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara establishes presence in Saudi Arabia </h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F17_baddc8ab6d.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F17_baddc8ab6d.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F17_baddc8ab6d.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2015</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara broadens its horizons with new projects in Pune and Hyderabad, while strengthening its presence in Mumbai and Goa </h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F14_c9b2d5e8c2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F14_c9b2d5e8c2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F14_c9b2d5e8c2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2018</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara launches BluNex Life –Next gen intelligent homes in collaboration with Google </h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FWHC_800_x_682_455477a54b.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FWHC_800_x_682_455477a54b.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FWHC_800_x_682_455477a54b.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2019</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara introduces the WorldHome Collection – Ultra-Luxury residences crafted for unparallelled sophistication </h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_23_T155206_781_95a176519a.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_23_T155206_781_95a176519a.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_23_T155206_781_95a176519a.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2019</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">2019 the year Zentech was launched as a project solely under Purva Commercial name.</h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F18_178f53d0c8.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F18_178f53d0c8.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F18_178f53d0c8.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2023</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara Forays into the redevelopment space in Mumbai </h4></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide custom-slide mt-5"><div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between position-relative"><div class="div-left"><img alt="bgImage" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid w-100 h-100" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_0b742dde65.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_0b742dde65.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2F50_Years_0b742dde65.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="div-right"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title text-white " data-splitting="">2025</h3></div><h4 class="title open-sans text-white">Puravankara celebrates 50 glorious years of excellence in real estate development, building trust and transforming lives </h4></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="justify-content-center row"><div class="col-lg-7 col-md-10"><div class="timeline-container  me-0 me-md-5 my-5  d-flex justify-content-end align-items-center position-relative"><button class="cust-swiper-button-prev position-relative bg-transparent border-0" aria-label="Prev"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="91" height="66" viewBox="0 0 91 66" fill="none"><circle cx="33" cy="33" r="32.6333" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 66 0)" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.733333"></circle><path d="M34.6402 32.8472C34.4484 32.6485 34.4541 32.3319 34.6528 32.1402L37.8911 29.0155C38.0898 28.8238 38.4063 28.8294 38.5981 29.0282C38.7898 29.2269 38.7842 29.5434 38.5855 29.7351L35.707 32.5126L38.4845 35.3911C38.6762 35.5898 38.6706 35.9064 38.4718 36.0981C38.2731 36.2898 37.9566 36.2842 37.7648 36.0855L34.6402 32.8472ZM90.9911 33.9999L34.9911 32.9999L35.0089 32.0001L91.0089 33.0001L90.9911 33.9999Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="timeline-line"><svg width="100%" height="8"><line x1="5%" y1="50%" x2="95%" y2="50%" stroke="gray" stroke-width="3"></line></svg></div><div class="swiper timeline-swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="timeline-dot-wrapper"><div class="timeline-dot active"></div><p class