class="timeline-dot-wrapper"><div class="timeline-dot "></div><p class="timeline-year">2019</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="timeline-dot-wrapper"><div class="timeline-dot "></div><p class="timeline-year">2019</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="timeline-dot-wrapper"><div class="timeline-dot "></div><p class="timeline-year">2023</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="timeline-dot-wrapper"><div class="timeline-dot "></div><p class="timeline-year">2025</p></div></div></div></div><button class="cust-swiper-button-next position-relative bg-transparent border-0" aria-label="Next"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="91" height="66" viewBox="0 0 91 66" fill="none"><circle cx="58" cy="33" r="32.6333" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.733333"></circle><path d="M56.3598 32.8472C56.5516 32.6485 56.5459 32.3319 56.3472 32.1402L53.1089 29.0155C52.9102 28.8238 52.5937 28.8294 52.4019 29.0282C52.2102 29.2269 52.2158 29.5434 52.4145 29.7351L55.293 32.5126L52.5155 35.3911C52.3238 35.5898 52.3294 35.9064 52.5282 36.0981C52.7269 36.2898 53.0434 36.2842 53.2352 36.0855L56.3598 32.8472ZM0.00892715 33.9999L56.0089 32.9999L55.9911 32.0001L-0.00892715 33.0001L0.00892715 33.9999Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec-padd position-relative overflow-hidden"><div class="container"><div class="gx-5 align-items-center row"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="imgwrap mt-4 mt-md-0 position-relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px)"><div class="sustainimg mb-4"><img alt="Mr.RAVI PURAVANKARA" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="img-fluid position-relative object-fit-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FDSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)"><div class="head_wrap"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title  " data-splitting="">Chairman&#x27;s Message</h3></div></div><div class="contentwrap"><p class="md-text fw-semibold mb-0">Mr.RAVI PURAVANKARA</p><p class="sm-text">Founder &amp; Chairman</p><div class="content"><p>If there is one reason why Puravankara has evolved consistently across the last five decades to emerge as one of India’s fastest growing real estate development companies, it is because we have invested in our core values with passion to the point that they have become a part of our culture. And this culture is putting ‘People at the heart of everything we do’, be it customers, employees, community, government, shareholders or business partners.</p><p>While appraising the performance of real estate development companies, it would be simplistic to believe that success is derived from the ability to mobilize financial resources, buy land parcels, appoint dependable contractors and market apartments. At Puravankara Projects, we feel that success is derived from the ability to lead, motivate, inspire, delegate and empower.</p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a class="flat_btn" href="/board-of-directors/mr-ravi-puravankara">Read More</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec-padd pt-0 overview position-relative"><div class="container"><div class="g-4 gx-xl-5 align-items-center row"><div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6 col-md-12"><div class="head_wrap"><div class="head_wrap"><h3 class="section-title  " data-splitting="">Group Companies</h3></div></div><div class="contentwrap"><div class="nav nav-pills  justify-content-strategic gap-3 gap-lg-4 mb-4" role="tablist"><div class="nav-item"><a role="tab" data-rr-ui-event-key="1" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-1" aria-controls="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-1" aria-selected="true" class="w-auto nav-link active" tabindex="0" href="#">Provident Housing</a></div><div class="nav-item"><a role="tab" data-rr-ui-event-key="2" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-2" aria-controls="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="w-auto nav-link" href="#">Purva Land</a></div><div class="nav-item"><a role="tab" data-rr-ui-event-key="3" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-3" aria-controls="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="w-auto nav-link" href="#"> Purva Streaks</a></div><div class="nav-item"><a role="tab" data-rr-ui-event-key="4" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-4" aria-controls="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-4" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="w-auto nav-link" href="#"> Starworth</a></div></div><div class="position-relative tab-content"><div role="tabpanel" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-1" aria-labelledby="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-1" class="fade tab-pane active show"><div><p>A 100% subsidiary of Puravankara Limited, Provident Housing carries its legacy with a portfolio of remarkable residential developments across 9 cities, namely, Bengaluru, Chennai, Coimbatore, Goa, Hyderabad, Kochi, Mumbai, Mangalore and Pune. With a family of 55,000+ happy residents, the company’s mammoth scale of development is evidenced by its track record of ~20 million square feet of projects: ~12.8 million square feet completed and ~7.2 million square feet of ongoing projects. Additionally, ~5.2 million square feet are planned and are under approval for new launches.</p><p>Customer obsession is at the heart of everything we do at Provident Housing. This credo guides us in every aspect of our work, from design to handover, ensuring that we consistently enhance the customer’s experience and elevate their lifestyle with homes designed for more.</p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a class="flat_btn" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.providenthousing.com">Know More</a></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-2" aria-labelledby="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-2" class="fade tab-pane"><div><p>Purva Land is a dedicated arm of Puravankara one of India’s most trusted real estate brands for developing theme-based plotted developments with an innovative approach to modern living seamlessly blending nature with luxury. Each project is designed to deliver a premium lifestyle experience, featuring world-class infrastructure, strategic locations with clear titles, and thoughtfully planned layouts to meet the needs of both investors and end users.</p><p>Every project is conceptualized with a unique theme, whether it’s wellness, sustainability, or luxury, offering a distinct identity and purpose. These themes are brought to life through curated amenities, lush green spaces, and innovative design elements, ensuring unparalleled value beyond the land itself.</p><p>Experience the future of plotted developments with Purva Land—where every plot is a story of elegance, innovation, and opportunity.</p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a class="flat_btn" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.purvaland.com/">Know More</a></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-3" aria-labelledby="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-3" class="fade tab-pane"><div><p>Purva Streaks, the interiors division of Puravankara Limited, is India's leading provider of end-to-end interior solutions. The brand is synonymous with quality, trust, and innovation in the furniture sector. Purva Streaks specialises in designing, building, and delivering ultra-modern, functional, and aesthetic interiors tailored to each client's unique taste and lifestyle.</p><p>At the heart of Purva Streaks lies its powerhouse of precision—Purva Woodworks, one of the most advanced interior manufacturing facilities in the industry today.</p><p>The facility houses exclusive production lines dedicated to Pre-hung Door Systems, Modular Kitchens, Wardrobes with a full spectrum of interior solutions.&nbsp;</p><p>Key offerings include modular factory-finished pre-hung door systems for large-format residential building complexes, kitchens, wardrobes, TV units, vanities, false ceilings, and comprehensive home décor services. With German construction standards, advanced automated manufacturing, and over 80 quality checkpoints, Purva Streaks guarantees precision and excellence in every project.</p><p>Purva Streaks’ extensive portfolio spans residential and commercial interiors, featuring solutions like customised fit-outs, pre-hung doors, and specialised finishes. The brand's customer-centric approach is reinforced by a 3-year product warranty, robust after-sales support, and a commitment to on-time delivery, often within 45 days. Serving over 25,000 satisfied customers, Purva Streaks stands as a trusted name for creating harmonious, elegant spaces across major Indian cities.</p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a class="flat_btn" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.purvastreaks.com/">Know More</a></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="react-aria-:R9da6:-tabpane-4" aria-labelledby="react-aria-:R9da6:-tab-4" class="fade tab-pane"><div><p>Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) is a wholly-owned subsidiary, the Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) arm of Puravankara - focused on technology-enabled construction solutions.</p><p>Established in 2008 as an independent general contracting firm, SICL was envisioned to serve external contracts and back-end services for the Puravankara group. With a focus on delivering superior value to clients, SICL offers construction services, combining innovative technology with customer-centric solutions.</p><p>SICL has built over 21 msft across India, spanning residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure sectors. Guided by the philosophy of "Imagine | Innovate | Integrate," the company has developed a business model that ensures the delivery of high-quality projects on time with high safety standards. The company is currently executing about 10 msft of projects across India.</p><p>The company’s precast factory in Bengaluru, with an annual capacity of 3 msft and provision for a 25% expansion, is a cornerstone of its operations. Enabled by an in-house design team and collaborations with IIT Chennai for design vetting, SICL excels in value engineering to provide economical and efficient solutions.</p><p>With expertise in conventional and precast construction, SICL stands out for its commitment to sustainability, safety, and precision, making it a trusted name in the Indian construction industry.</p></div><div class="btnwrap"><a class="flat_btn" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.starworthinfra.com">Know More</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6 col-md-12"><div class="content-wrapper ms-xl-3 mt-md-0"><div class="counter-container position"><div class="rotatebox position-absolute end-0 bottom-0"></div><div class="counter-wrapper position-relative"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="rotatebox position-absolute top-0 start-0 end-0 centerbox mb-4 text-center"></div></div><div class="row g-2 company-logos g-sm-4 justify-content-center"><div class="col-6 col-lg-6"><div class="counter_item" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)"><div class="icon_wrap" style="transition:filter 0.3s ease-in-out"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="284" height="94" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FProvident_6b951b389a.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FProvident_6b951b389a.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FProvident_6b951b389a.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="col-6 col-lg-6"><div class="counter_item" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)"><div class="icon_wrap" style="transition:filter 0.3s ease-in-out"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="284" height="94" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FPurva_Land_3fa8eb41a6.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FPurva_Land_3fa8eb41a6.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FPurva_Land_3fa8eb41a6.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="col-6 col-lg-6"><div class="counter_item" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)"><div class="icon_wrap" style="transition:filter 0.3s ease-in-out"><img alt="icon" loading="lazy" width="284" height="94" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="img-fluid" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fuploads%2FNew_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_