l,"size":1.95,"width":245,"height":100,"sizeInBytes":1946}},"hash":"50_Years_web_page-01","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":19.28,"url":"/uploads/50_Years_web_page-01.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-28T09:01:44.236Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T09:43:29.151Z"}}}},"Overview":{"id":1,"sectionTitle":"What Sets Us Apart","sectionSubtitle":"Overview","Description":"\u003cp style=\"margin-left:0cm;\"\u003eFounded in 1975, Puravankara Limited is one of India’s most admired and trusted developers among the\u0026nbsp;top real estate companies in India. The Company has its headquarters in Bengaluru.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin-left:0cm;\"\u003eFor five decades, the brand has been built on an unwavering commitment towards customer delight, responsibility, and trust.\u0026nbsp; Every Puravankara home reflects our respect for one of life’s most important investments. By placing customers at the centre of every decision we take, we continue to create enduring spaces that combine quality, reliability, and lasting value.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin-left:0cm;\"\u003ePuravankara has launched three prominent brands. Puravankara itself is recognized for its luxurious, state-of-the-art projects that incorporate innovative technology to redefine future homes. Provident Housing Ltd., a wholly owned subsidiary launched in 2008, addresses the needs of mid-income homeowners. Additionally, Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) provide technology-enabled construction solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin-left:0cm;\"\u003eThe Puravankara brand also has a strong presence in commercial office spaces.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"data":{"id":1110,"attributes":{"name":"overview_celrmont_750cbd549f.webp","alternativeText":"Real Estate Company in India","caption":null,"width":800,"height":682,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp","hash":"small_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f.webp","path":null,"size":31.08,"width":500,"height":426,"sizeInBytes":31076},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp","hash":"medium_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f.webp","path":null,"size":54.06,"width":750,"height":639,"sizeInBytes":54062},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp","hash":"thumbnail_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_overview_celrmont_750cbd549f.webp","path":null,"size":6.48,"width":183,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":6480}},"hash":"overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":69.88,"url":"/uploads/overview_celrmont_750cbd549f_88e133eb36.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-19T13:18:52.246Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T09:44:34.978Z"}}}},"vision_mission":{"id":1,"philosophy":{"id":2,"title":"\"The You\" Philosophy","description":"At Puravankara, all our endeavours revolve around just one entity - our customers. Their need, dreams and aspirations are pivotal to our decisions. We call this \"The you philosophy\".","image":{"data":{"id":978,"attributes":{"name":"image (16).png","alternativeText":"Puravankara – Top Real Estate Developers in India | Benguluru, Mumbai, Pune \u0026 More","caption":null,"width":840,"height":446,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/small_image_16_a22620a905.png","hash":"small_image_16_a22620a905","mime":"image/png","name":"small_image (16).png","path":null,"size":282.53,"width":500,"height":265,"sizeInBytes":282527},"medium":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/medium_image_16_a22620a905.png","hash":"medium_image_16_a22620a905","mime":"image/png","name":"medium_image (16).png","path":null,"size":614.73,"width":750,"height":398,"sizeInBytes":614734},"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_image_16_a22620a905.png","hash":"thumbnail_image_16_a22620a905","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_image (16).png","path":null,"size":73.61,"width":245,"height":130,"sizeInBytes":73605}},"hash":"image_16_a22620a905","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":200.26,"url":"/uploads/image_16_a22620a905.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-18T04:58:28.307Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-01T12:44:00.774Z"}}}},"mission":{"id":1,"title":"Our Vision","description":"To create a sustainable world for people to live their dreams.","image":{"data":{"id":1105,"attributes":{"name":"mission.png","alternativeText":"Puravankara - Top Builders in Bangalore ","caption":null,"width":603,"height":473,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/small_mission_7dd61b7161.png","hash":"small_mission_7dd61b7161","mime":"image/png","name":"small_mission.png","path":null,"size":451.17,"width":500,"height":392,"sizeInBytes":451170},"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_mission_7dd61b7161.png","hash":"thumbnail_mission_7dd61b7161","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_mission.png","path":null,"size":79.22,"width":199,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":79215}},"hash":"mission_7dd61b7161","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":146.32,"url":"/uploads/mission_7dd61b7161.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-19T12:59:38.859Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:42:48.748Z"}}}}},"qualitypolicy":{"id":1,"sectiontitle":"Explore Our Quality Policy","subtitle":"OUR POLICIES"},"qualityslides":[{"id":1,"title":"Quality Management System","description":"\u003cp\u003eQuality Management System’ is a repository of processes and systems, which deﬁne all activities at Puravankara. The QMS ensures delivery of a quality product at optimum cost and minimum impact to the environment and society at large. QMS training is mandatory for all employees. Puravankara’s QMS conforms to the ISO 9001 standard.\u003c/p\u003e","cta":[],"image":{"data":{"id":982,"attributes":{"name":"img-1.jpg","alternativeText":"Puravankara - Top Builders in Bangalore","caption":null,"width":643,"height":598,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/small_img_1_a942151cc4.jpg","hash":"small_img_1_a942151cc4","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_img-1.jpg","path":null,"size":17.52,"width":500,"height":465,"sizeInBytes":17520},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_img_1_a942151cc4.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_img_1_a942151cc4","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_img-1.jpg","path":null,"size":3.57,"width":167,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":3574}},"hash":"img_1_a942151cc4","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":25.83,"url":"/uploads/img_1_a942151cc4.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-18T06:03:54.182Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-01T12:47:24.718Z"}}}},{"id":2,"title":"Project Management","description":"\u003cp\u003eProject Management is a monthly review of ongoing projects where PICs present progress reports aligned with international best practices, covering progress, cost, inventory, and risks. Senior management participation enables quick issue resolution and faster execution. Projects are rated on progress, schedule, cost, quality, safety, and housekeeping, with monthly commendations for outstanding projects and quarterly awards for best-in-class performance.\u003c/p\u003e","cta":[],"image":{"data":{"id":981,"attributes":{"name":"2.jpg","alternativeText":"top real estate companies in india","caption":null,"width":643,"height":598,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/small_2_6fab44c9a5.jpg","hash":"small_2_6fab44c9a5","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_2.jpg","path":null,"size":39.49,"width":500,"height":465,"sizeInBytes":39491},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_2_6fab44c9a5.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_2_6fab44c9a5","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbna