nder's Desk","foundername":"Mr.RAVI PURAVANKARA","designation":"Founder \u0026 Chairman","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf there is one reason why Puravankara has evolved consistently across the last five decades to emerge as one of India’s fastest growing real estate development companies, it is because we have invested in our core values with passion to the point that they have become a part of our culture. And this culture is putting ‘People at the heart of everything we do’, be it customers, employees, community, government, shareholders or business partners.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhile appraising the performance of real estate development companies, it would be simplistic to believe that success is derived from the ability to mobilize financial resources, buy land parcels, appoint dependable contractors and market apartments. At Puravankara Projects, we feel that success is derived from the ability to lead, motivate, inspire, delegate and empower.\u003c/p\u003e","founderimg":{"data":{"id":2757,"attributes":{"name":"DSC_5076 copy-1.jpg","alternativeText":"Puravankara - Top Builders in Bangalore","caption":null,"width":4256,"height":2832,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/large_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg","hash":"large_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"large_DSC_5076 copy-1.jpg","path":null,"size":52.44,"width":1000,"height":665,"sizeInBytes":52437},"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/small_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg","hash":"small_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_DSC_5076 copy-1.jpg","path":null,"size":18.58,"width":500,"height":333,"sizeInBytes":18578},"medium":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/medium_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg","hash":"medium_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"medium_DSC_5076 copy-1.jpg","path":null,"size":33.83,"width":750,"height":499,"sizeInBytes":33832},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_DSC_5076 copy-1.jpg","path":null,"size":6.35,"width":234,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":6349}},"hash":"DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":571.47,"url":"/uploads/DSC_5076_copy_1_2b5f22b9e7.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-06-18T05:41:21.279Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:48:52.879Z"}}}},"companiesoverview":{"id":1,"sectiontitle":"Group Companies","subtitle":"Companies Overview","companiestab":[{"id":1,"title":"Provident Housing","desc":"\u003cp\u003eA 100% subsidiary of Puravankara Limited, Provident Housing carries its legacy with a portfolio of remarkable residential developments across 9 cities, namely, Bengaluru, Chennai, Coimbatore, Goa, Hyderabad, Kochi, Mumbai, Mangalore and Pune. With a family of 55,000+ happy residents, the company’s mammoth scale of development is evidenced by its track record of ~20 million square feet of projects: ~12.8 million square feet completed and ~7.2 million square feet of ongoing projects. Additionally, ~5.2 million square feet are planned and are under approval for new launches.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomer obsession is at the heart of everything we do at Provident Housing. This credo guides us in every aspect of our work, from design to handover, ensuring that we consistently enhance the customer’s experience and elevate their lifestyle with homes designed for more.\u003c/p\u003e","Link":"www.providenthousing.com","image":{"data":{"id":176,"attributes":{"name":"Provident.webp","alternativeText":"Puravankara","caption":null,"width":284,"height":94,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_Provident_6b951b389a.webp","hash":"thumbnail_Provident_6b951b389a","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_Provident.webp","path":null,"size":3.27,"width":245,"height":81,"sizeInBytes":3274}},"hash":"Provident_6b951b389a","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":3.55,"url":"/uploads/Provident_6b951b389a.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-10T02:51:58.073Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:49:07.186Z"}}}},{"id":2,"title":"Purva Land","desc":"\u003cp\u003ePurva Land is a dedicated arm of Puravankara one of India’s most trusted real estate brands for developing theme-based plotted developments with an innovative approach to modern living seamlessly blending nature with luxury. Each project is designed to deliver a premium lifestyle experience, featuring world-class infrastructure, strategic locations with clear titles, and thoughtfully planned layouts to meet the needs of both investors and end users.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery project is conceptualized with a unique theme, whether it’s wellness, sustainability, or luxury, offering a distinct identity and purpose. These themes are brought to life through curated amenities, lush green spaces, and innovative design elements, ensuring unparalleled value beyond the land itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExperience the future of plotted developments with Purva Land—where every plot is a story of elegance, innovation, and opportunity.\u003c/p\u003e","Link":"https://www.purvaland.com/","image":{"data":{"id":177,"attributes":{"name":"Purva Land.webp","alternativeText":"Puravankara - Top Builders in Bangalore","caption":null,"width":284,"height":94,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_Purva_Land_3fa8eb41a6.webp","hash":"thumbnail_Purva_Land_3fa8eb41a6","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_Purva Land.webp","path":null,"size":3.29,"width":245,"height":81,"sizeInBytes":3294}},"hash":"Purva_Land_3fa8eb41a6","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":3.39,"url":"/uploads/Purva_Land_3fa8eb41a6.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-10T02:52:08.821Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:49:14.755Z"}}}},{"id":3,"title":" Purva Streaks","desc":"\u003cp\u003ePurva Streaks, the interiors division of Puravankara Limited, is India's leading provider of end-to-end interior solutions. The brand is synonymous with quality, trust, and innovation in the furniture sector. Purva Streaks specialises in designing, building, and delivering ultra-modern, functional, and aesthetic interiors tailored to each client's unique taste and lifestyle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of Purva Streaks lies its powerhouse of precision—Purva Woodworks, one of the most advanced interior manufacturing facilities in the industry today.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe facility houses exclusive production lines dedicated to Pre-hung Door Systems, Modular Kitchens, Wardrobes with a full spectrum of interior solutions.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey offerings include modular factory-finished pre-hung door systems for large-format residential building complexes, kitchens, wardrobes, TV units, vanities, false ceilings, and comprehensive home décor services. With German construction standards, advanced automated manufacturing, and over 80 quality checkpoints, Purva Streaks guarantees precision and excellence in every project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePurva Streaks’ extensive portfolio spans residential and commercial interiors, featuring solutions like customised fit-outs, pre-hung doors, and specialised finishes. The brand's customer-centric approach is reinforced by a 3-year product warranty, robust after-sales support, and a commitment to on-time delivery, often within 45 days. Serving over 25,000 satisfied customers, Purva Streaks stands as a trusted name for creating harmonious, elegant spaces across major Indian cities.\u003c/p\u003e","Link":"www.purvastreaks.com/","image":{"data":{"id":2852,"attributes":{"name":"New Project - 2025-07-09T175355.216.png","alternativeText":"best real estate company in bangalore","caption":null,"width":284,"height":94,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_New_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a.png","hash":"thumbnail_New_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_New Project - 2025-07-09T175355.216.png","path":null,"size":16.94,"width":245,"height":81,"sizeInBytes":16936}},"hash":"New_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":5.17,"url":"/uploads/New_Project_2025_07_09_T175355_216_61ab86948a.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-07-09T12:24:07.190Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:49:40.257Z"}}}},{"id":4,"title":" Starworth","desc":"\u003cp\u003eStarworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) is a wholly-owned subsidiary, the Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) arm of Puravankara - focused on technology-enabled construction solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEstablished in 2008 as an independent general contracting firm, SICL was envisioned to serve external contracts and back-end services for the Puravankara group. With a focus on delivering superior value to clients, SICL offers construction services, combining innovative technology with customer-centric solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSICL has built over 21 msft across India, spanning residential, commercial, industrial, and infrastructure sectors. Guided by the philosophy of \"Imagine | Innovate | Integrate,\" the company has developed a business model that ensures the delivery of high-quality projects on time with high safety standards. The company is currently executing about 10 msft of projects across India.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe company’s precast factory in Bengaluru, with an annual capacity of 3 msft and provision for a 25% expansion, is a cornerstone of its operations. Enabled by an in-house design team and collaborations with IIT Chennai for design vetting, SICL excels in value engineering to provide economical and efficient solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith expertise in conventional and precast construction, SICL stands out for its commitment to sustainability, safety, and precision, making it a trusted name in the Indian construction industry.\u003c/p\u003e","Link":"www.starworthinfra.com","image":{"data":{"id":179,"attributes":{"name":"Starworth.webp","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":284,"height":94,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_Starworth_19b5047447.webp","hash":"thumbnail_Starworth_19b5047447","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_Starworth.webp","path":null,"size":6.48,"width":245,"height":81,"sizeInBytes":6476}},"hash":"Starworth_19b5047447","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":7.97,"url":"/uploads/Starworth_19b5047447.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-10T02:52:29.786Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-10T02:52:29.786Z"}}}}]},"sustainability":{"id":2,"sectionTitle":"Sustainable Luxury, Built for the Future","sectionSubtitle":"Sustainability","Description":"\u003cp\u003eAt Puravankara, \u003ca href=\"https://www.puravankara.com/sustainability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(240,75%,60%);\"\u003esustainability\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/a\u003eisn’t just a commitment, it’s a way of life. We seamlessly blend eco-conscious design with luxurious living, ensuring every home is crafted with energy-efficient materials, advanced water conservation systems, and effective waste management solutions. Our thoughtfully designed landscapes feature native plants, rainwater harvesting, and expansive green spaces, fostering a deep connection with nature.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith energy efficiency at the core of our developments, we actively minimize our carbon footprint and integrate eco-friendly practices across all projects. By prioritizing sustainable innovation, Puravankara is shaping a greener tomorrow, one home at a time.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"data":{"id":3305,"attributes":{"name":"2_16e3dac6e1.webp","alternativeText":"Puravankara - Top Builders in india","caption":null,"width":800,"height":682,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b.webp","hash":"small_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_2_16e3dac6e1.webp","path":null,"size":33.42,"width":500,"height":426,"sizeInBytes":33418},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b.webp","hash":"medium_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_2_16e3dac6e1.webp","path":null,"size":60.07,"width":750,"height":639,"sizeInBytes":60072},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b.webp","hash":"thumbnail_2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_2_16e3dac6e1.webp","path":null,"size":6.09,"width":183,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":6092}},"hash":"2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":77.32,"url":"/uploads/2_16e3dac6e1_ff73d8d17b.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-08-14T05:50:57.863Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-10T06:50:02.897Z"}}}},"Awards":{"id":16,"sectionTitle":"Our Awards","sectionSubtitle":"Recognition of Excellence","showAwards":true,"awards":{"data":[{"id":61,"attributes":{"Title":"17th Realty+ Excellence Awards 2025 – South","shortDescription":"Ultra Luxury-Lifestyle Project of the Year - Purva Orient Grand","year":"2025","createdAt":"2025-11-21T11:42:28.339Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-25T10:08:39.654Z","publishedAt":"2025-11-21T11:42:29.757Z"}},{"id":60,"attributes":{"Title":"17th Realty+ Excellence Awards 2025 – South","shortDescription":"Iconic Project of the Year- Purva Blubelle","year":"2025","createdAt":"2025-11-21T11:37:23.623Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-25T10:06:56.115Z","publishedAt":"2025-11-21T11:37:25.038Z"}},{"id":1,"attributes":{"Title":"15th CIDC Viswakarma Awards","shortDescription":"Achievement award for creating social development and impact","year":"2024","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:48:14.321Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-04T12:26:58.550Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:48:15.921Z"}},{"id":51,"attributes":{"Title":"Lifetime Achievement Award by CREDAI - Karnataka","shortDescription":" Ravi Puravankara\n","year":"2023","createdAt":"2025-03-29T05:55:15.004Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-29T06:03:33.902Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-29T05:55:17.386Z"}},{"id":4,"attributes":{"Title":"14th Realty+ Conclave \u0026 Excellence Awards - WEST","shortDescription":"Design project of the year - Purva Clermont","year":"2022","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:49:30.082Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-04T12:27:45.265Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:49:31.706Z"}},{"id":5,"attributes":{"Title":"14th Realty+ Conclave and Excellence Awards - SOUTH","shortDescription":"Residential complex of the year - Purva Zenium","year":"2022","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:49:46.181Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-04T12:27:57.084Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:49:47.826Z"}},{"id":6,"attributes":{"Title":"Construction Times BAM Awards ","shortDescription":"Builder of the year - Medium","year":"2022","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:51:02.238Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-29T06:08:42.881Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:51:04.034Z"}},{"id":8,"attributes":{"Title":"13th REALTY+ CONCLAVE \u0026 EXCELLENCE AWARDS ","shortDescription":"Design project of the year - Purva Emerald Bay","year":"2022","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:51:35.311Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-04T12:28:40.067Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:51:36.144Z"}},{"id":13,"attributes":{"Title":"12th REALTY+ CONCLAVE \u0026 EXCELLENCE AWARDS ","shortDescription":"Design project of the year - Purva Zenium","year":"2020","createdAt":"2025-03-17T15:53:08.563Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-04T12:30:26.565Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-17T15:53:10.053Z"}}]}},"HeaderTags":[{"id":45,"Title":"Puravankara – Innovating Real Estate with Sustainability \u0026 Technology","Tag":"H1"},{"id":46,"Title":"What Sets Us Apart, OUR JOURNEY, About Founder, Group of companies","Tag":"H2"},{"id":47,"Title":"Sustainable Luxury, Built for the Future","Tag":"H3"}]}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/about-u